<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 Timote</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timote</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kai Pawl, na ka rungngangkung Cathut hoi, maimouh ni ngaihawi e Jisuh Khrih e kâpoelawk lahoi Jisuh Khrih e guncei lah kaawm e ni yuemnae lahoi ka ca katang lah kaawm e Timote koe ca na patawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pa Cathut hoi maimae Jisuh Khrih koehoi lungmanae, pahrennae hoi lungmawngnae teh nang koe awm lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Masidonia ram lah ka cei navah kai ni na hroecoe e patetlah Efisa kho la na o teh, alouklouk e cangkhainae cangkhai hoeh nahanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />lairuipakong hoi ka pout thai hoeh e miphun tâconae hah banglah pouk awh hoeh nahanelah, cingthui haw. Hote hnonaw niteh yuemnae hlak kâounnae doeh a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei kâpoelawk ni ngainae teh, kathounge lungthin hoi thoseh, kathounge mahoima kâpanuenae hoi thoseh, kathounge yuemnae hoi thoseh, kâkuen e lungpatawnae hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote hno dawk hoi tami tangawn ni a roun awh teh, aphu kaawm hoeh e lawk deinae koe lah a kamlang awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangpatetlae phung koe lah maw kacaklah ka o awh tie hai kâpanuek awh laipalah, kacangkhaikung saya lah o han a ngai awh bo aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kâlawk teh hnokahawi kasaknaw hanelah ta e nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kâlawklaipa hoi lawkkangaihoehnaw, cathutlaipa hoi tamikayonnaw, kathounghoehnaw hoi lawkkatang banglahai ka pouk hoeh e naw, manu kathetnaw hoi na pa kathetnaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tami kathetnaw, kamsoumhoehe napui tongpa yonnae kasaknaw, tongpa reira yonnae kasaknaw, tami kaparawtnaw, laithoe kadeinaw, laithoe koe lah thoekâbonaw, kathounge cangkhainae katarannaw pueng hanelah doeh kâlawk teh ta pouh e lah ao. Hote kâlawk hah hmantang ka hno e taminaw teh, hote kâlawk ni hawinae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hottelah ka ti navah, Yawhawi Cathut e bawilen kamthang kahawi teh kai na poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai hah thaonae hoi na kakawisakkung maimae Bawipa Khrih Jisuh e a lungmanae teh ka pholen. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni ni a thaw tawk hane lah na rawi teh yuemkamcu lah na pouk toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai teh ahmaloe vah, kapathoekung, kadudamkung, ayâ karektapkung lah ka o eiteh, yuemhoehnae hoi panuek laipalah hoi ka tawksak e a tho dawkvah, lungmanae ka coenae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maimae Bawipa e a lungmanae haiyah, Khrih Jisuh thung kaawm e yuemnae hoi lungpatawnae hoi cungtalah pouk e hlak a kuep toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrih Jisuh ni het talaivan a tho ngainae teh tamikayon rungngang hanlah a tho tie teh, yuemkamcu e hoi dâw hane roeroe lah a kamcu. Hote tamikayonnaw thung dawkvah kai teh kalenpounge lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hateiteh, a yungyoe hringnae coe nahanlah ka yuem hane naw ni a dawn han kawi lah ao nahan, kalenpounge yonnae ka tawn e kai hah Jisuh Khrih ni lungsawnae hoi panguepnae na patue toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A yungyoe siangpahrang, kangning e, hmuthaihoehe, Cathut buet touh dueng teh barinae, bawilennae a yungyoe hoi a yungyoe awm lawiseh, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka capa Timote, nang hanelah profet lahoi ka pâpho e naw hoi hete cingthuilawknaw hah nang koe na poe. Hethateh, yuemnae hoi kathounge panuenae lung na tawn teh kahawi e tarankâtuknae na tuk thai nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami tangawn ni yuemnae a takhoe awh dawkvah, yuemnae long a rawk teh rawknae koe a pha awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hotnaw thung dawkvah Himenaias hoi Alexander a bawk roi. Ahnimouh roi ni Cathut dudamnae lawk a dei roi hoeh nahanelah a kamtu roi nahan Setan kut dawk ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami pueng hanelah hai thoseh, siangpahrangnaw hoi kâ katawnnaw hanelah hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ratoum pouh hane hoi lunghawilawkdeinae ahmaloe na sak awh nahan kai ni na hroecoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah tinae teh maimae rungngangkung Cathut hmalah ngai kaawm e lah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami pueng rungngang lah o vaiteh, lawkkatang panuenae koe pha sak hanelah Cathut ni a ngainae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cathut teh buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Cathut hoi taminaw rahak tami lah kaawm e Khrih Jisuh buet touh dueng doeh laicei lah kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahni ni tami pueng ratang hanelah a tak a pasoung toe. A tue a pha toteh a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai teh kapâphokung lah thoseh, guncei lah thoseh, yuemnae hoi Khrih thung e lawkkatang hah Jentelnaw koe ka pâpho hane saya lahai thoseh, na ta toe. Hottelah ka dei nah laithoe ka dei hoeh, hmantang doeh ka dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tongpanaw ni hmuen tangkuem koe, lungkhueknae, kâounnae awm laipalah, kathounge kut dâw laihoi na ratoum awh nahanlah na ngaikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hot patetvanlah, napuinaw ni samveinae, sui, pale, aphu kaawm e khohnanaw hoi kamthoup laipalah, mitkhet kamcu lah kamthoup awh nateh, lungdo lungnem lahoi kacuemkamui lah awm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cathut ka barilawa e napuinaw ni a kamthoup hanelah ao e patetlah, kamcu e nuen hoi kamthoup awh na seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Napuinaw teh lawkngai laihoi lawkkamuem lah kamtu naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Napui teh tongpanaw lathueng cangkhainae hoi kâtawnnae ka poe hoeh. Napui teh lawkkamuem ao hanlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Adam hmaloe a sak hnukkhu Evi sak e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hothloilah, Adam teh tacuek lah awm hoeh, Evi doeh tacuek lah kaawm niteh ka payon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hateiteh, napuinaw teh, kacuemkamui lah onae, yuemnae, lungpatawnae, thoungnae dawk awm awh pawiteh, cakhenae dawk rungngang lah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami buet touh ni bishop thaw tawk hanelah ngai pawiteh thaw kahawi ka ngai e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bishopnaw teh, tounhoehe, napui buet touh e vâ lah kaawm e,, kâhruetcuet e, kacuemkamui lah kaawm e, imyin ka ngai e, ka cangkhai thai e han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yamuhri lah kaawm hoeh e, ka pahngawpahrak hoeh e, kamsoum hoeh lahoi tangka hmu ka ngai hoeh e, a lung kanem e, ayâ hoi kâyue hoeh e, tangka ka hounloun hoeh e han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama e imthung kahawicalah ka uk thai niteh, a canaw ka yue ka toun thai e tami han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama e imthungkhu patenghai kahawicalah hrawi thai hoehpawiteh bangtelamaw kawhmoun a khetyawt thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kâthungtahma e tami mahoeh. Telah nahoeh pawiteh, ahni ni kâoup vaiteh, kahraimathout hoi kâvan e yonphukhangnae dawk bawt payon vaih tie ngaihrinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathoenae awm laipalah kahraimathout mannae dawk hoi a hlout nahan, alawilae taminaw koe bari kaawm e tami han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hot patetvanlah, hotunaw hai a lung kacakpounge han. A lai ka samphei e, yamuhri lah kaawm e tami mahoeh. Kathounghoehe tangka hmunae ka ngai hoeh e tami han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ma hoi ma kâpanuenae lung a thoung vaiteh yuemnae a dungkawnae hah mangkhak kangdoutkhai e tami han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahnimouh hai tanouknae hmaloe a kâhmo awh hnukkhu, tounhoehe lah awm pawiteh, hotunaw thaw tawk awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnimae yunaw hai a lung kacakpounge lah ao awh han. Tamcueklawk ka dei e lah awm laipalah, kâhruetcuet e, lawkkam kacakpounge lah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hotunaw teh, napui buet touh e vâ lah ao han. A yu a ca kahawicalah ka uk thai e han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hotunaw thaw kahawicalah katawknaw teh, amamouh hanelah min hawinae a hmu awh hloilah, Khrih Jisuh thung yuemnae dawkvah, taranhawinae a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang koe ca ka thut ngainae teh nang koe karanglah ka tho hane ka ngaihawi ei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka hnawng pawiteh Cathut e imthung dawkvah bangtelamaw kâroekâkhawi han tie hah, na panue thai nahanlah, hettelah ka thut teh na patawn. Hote im hateh, kahring Cathut e Kawhmoun doeh, lawkkatang e khom hoi adu pui doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cathut lawk hoi khosaknae teh atangcalah adungkaw tangngak. Cathut teh takthai dawk a kamnue toe. Muitha lahoi a katang doeh titeh a kampangkhai. Kalvantaminaw nihai a hmu awh toe. Jentelnaw nihai kamthang lawk a thai awh toe. Talaivan taminaw nihai a yuem awh toe. Bawilennae hoi lathueng lah tawm lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Muitha ni kamcengcalah a pâpho e teh, a to hmalah teh dumyennae muithanaw hoi kahraituilinaw e cangkhainae dawkvah dawn awh vaiteh, yuemnae a ceitakhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hote cangkhai e naw teh, amamae panuenae lung hah sumhmaisaan hoi kânep awh niteh, a lai kathout e, tami kahawi lah ka kâsak e naw koehoi doeh a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni kâpaluennae cakâ awh vaiteh, kayuem niteh lawkkatang ka panuek e taminaw ni lunghawilawkdeinae lahoi canei hane rawca Cathut ni a sak e hah a hai sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cathut ni a sak e pueng teh ahawi dawkvah lunghawilawkdeinae lahoi hno pawiteh, hnoun hane banghai awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut e lawk lahoi thoseh, ratoum e lahoi thoseh, bangpueng teh a thoung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hete lawknaw hah hmaunawnghanaw koe na dei pouh pawiteh, Jisuh Khrih e thaw ka tawk e, yuemnae lawknaw hoi kawkhik e lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Napui matawngnaw ni ouk a dei awh e lairuipakongnaw hah takhoe nateh, Cathutlae khosaknae lahoi namahoima kâcangkhai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Takthai dawk kâ cangkhainae teh hawinae moikapap awmhoeh. Cathut lawk dawk khosaknae teh atu e hringnae hoi due hnukkhu e hringnae totouh lawkkamnae ao dawkvah, bangpueng hanelah hawinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hethateh yuemkamcu e hoi dâw hane roeroe lah kamcu e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, maimouh teh hot hanelah thapatho teh panki laihoi tawk awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami pueng rungngangkung, alawkpui lah kayuemnaw e rungngangkung lah kaawm e kahring Cathut hah maimouh ni ngaihawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hete hnonaw hah kâ poe nateh cangkhaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nawnae hah apinihai, dudam hanh naseh. Lawk deinae, kâroekâkhawinae, ayânaw lungpatawnae, muitha hoi hringnae, lawkkamcaknae, thoungnae dawkvah, kayuemnaw han khetsin hanelah awm loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai ka tho hoehroukrak Cakathoung touknae, thapoenae hoi cangkhainae hah panki laihoi pou sak loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kacuenaw e kut toung e hoi sutdeilawk lahoi, nang koe poe lah kaawm e poehno hah noutna laipalah awm hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na roungnae teh taminaw koe kamnue sak nahanelah, hotnaw hah panki loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nama hoi nama na kâcangkhai nakunghai thoseh, na cangkhai e dawk hai thoseh, kâhruetcuet nateh pou awm loe. Hottelah na tetpawiteh nama hoi na lawk kathainaw hah na rungngang han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tongpa matawngnaw hah puenghoi yue laipalah, na pa patetlah thapoe loe. Tongpa kanaw hah hmaunawngha patetlah pouk loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Napui matawngnaw hah na manu patetlah pouk nateh, tanglanaw hah kathoungpounge na tawncei patetlah pouk loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lahmai lah kaawm katang e napuinaw hah bari nateh khenyawn loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hateiteh, hote lahmainu ni a ca catounnaw tawn pawiteh, hote ca catounnaw ni Cathut thaw lah a pouk awh vaiteh, mae im a khetyawt hoi, manu na pa mintoenaw khetyawtnae kamtu awh naseh. Hottelah tawknae teh Cathut ni a ngai e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khenyawnkung awm laipalah amadueng kaawm e lahmainu teh, Cathut kâuep laihoi karum khodai pout laipalah ouk a ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei, talai van nawmnae dawk ka cet e lahmainu teh a hring nahlangva kadout e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Apinihai tounhoehe lah ao nahan kâ poe loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Apipatethai imthung ka khenyawn hoeh e teh yuemnae ka pahnawt e lah ao teh, kayuemhoehnaw hlak hoe a mathoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum 60 kakuep hoeh rae teh lahmainu lah khoe hanh loe, a vâ buet touh dueng ouk kaawm e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a canaw kahawicalah ka khen thai e, imyin ka ngai e, tami kathoungnaw e khok ka pâsu e, rucat ka kâhmo e naw ka khenyawn e, kahawi hno kaawm e pueng ka tawk e lah awm pawiteh, lahmai lah khoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kum kanaw e lahmainunaw teh, lahmainu lah khoe hanh loe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Khrih e cangkhainae ngâi hoeh, vâ sak hanelah ngai pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ahmaloe lawkkam a raphoe dawkvah, yonphukhangnae ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Im touh hnukkhu im touh a luen awh teh, a pangak awh. Hottelah a pangak awh dueng tho laipalah, tamthoe a dei awh teh ayânaw e lai dawk a kâphum awh teh, dei kawi hoeh e hah ouk a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kanaw e lahmainu teh a vâ bout a tawn vaiteh, a canaw bout sak naseh. Ayâ ni bout pathoe hoeh nahanlah a imthung kahawicalah bout tawn naseh, pathoenae heh taran ni a tha kâla hoeh nahan lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lahmainu tangawn teh, lam a payon awh teh setan hnuk a kâbang awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka yuem e napui hoehpawiteh, tongpa ni ama hoi kâkuen e lahmainu tawn pawiteh, khenyawn naseh. Hat pawiteh doeh, lahmainu katangnaw hah tarawknae awm laipalah, kawhmoun ni a khetyawt thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kahawicalah ka uk e kacuenaw, alawkpui lah lawk pâphonae hoi cangkhainae dawkvah, panki laihoi ka tawk e kahrawikungnaw teh, let hni touh barinae lah awm awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cakathoung ni cangkatin lahun e maitotan a pahni moum pouh hanh, thawtawkkung ni a tawknae phu hmu hanelah a kamcu, telah bout a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kacue ni hno a sakpayon nah, kapanuekkhaikung kahni kathum touh awmhoeh pawiteh hote yonpennae teh dâw pouh hanh loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Alouke taminaw ni a taki nahan yonnae ka sak e tami teh taminaw hmalah yue loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kapeknae tawn laipalah, bang patet e hno dawk hai, kâkangkhai e tawn laipalah na tawk nahan, Bawipa Jisuh Khrih hoi Cathut hmalah, rawi lah kaawm e kalvantami hmalah ka patawpoung lah na hroecoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Apipatet e lathueng haiyah, kuttoungnae hmatara sak pouh hanh loe. Ayâ alouknaw e lumlai dawk hai bawk hanh loe. Nama hoi nama kamthoung loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na vonpui patawnae hoi atuhoitu na damhoehnae dawkvah, tui dueng net laipalah misurtui hai youn touh net khai loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami tangawn e yon teh lawkceng hoehnahlan a kamphawng toe. A tangawn e yon teh a hnukkhu doeh ouk a kamphawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hot patetvanlah hnokahawi sak e haiyah, bangpatet teh tang a kamnue, kamnuek hoeh rae hnokahawi sak e hai hrawk thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cathut min hoi cangkhainae teh dudam e lah ao hoeh nahan, patoun e san niteh a bawipa hah a bari hanelah a kamcu tie panuek naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bawipa teh ka yuem e lah awm pawiteh, hmaunawngha doeh tie lung hoi hnephnap laipalah, hoe kahawicalah tawk pouh awh naseh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahawicalah tawk pouh e ka coe e bawi teh, ka yuem e tami, lungpataw kawi e tami lahai ao. Hetnaw heh cangkhai nateh hroecoe loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami buetbuet touh ni ka thuem hoeh e cangkhainae hah a cangkhaia teh, maimae Bawipa Jesuh Khrih e kathounge cangkhainae hoi cathutlae cangkhainae ka tarawi hoeh e tami teh, lunglenpansa lah kaawm niteh banghai ka panuek hoeh e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lawklung kâounnae hoi kamcan dawk a lung kapen e lah ao awh. Hot kecu dawkvah, hounroenae, kâyuenae, dudam lawk deinae, lunghringnae ouk a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hottelah panuenae lung a kamko dawkvah, lawkkatang ka bawk hoeh e kâounnae lah ao teh, Cathut lawk dawk khosaknae teh aphu ao toungloung katetnaw koe ka pout thai hoeh e kâounnae ouk a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei, lungkuepnae lahoi Cathut lawk dawk khosaknae teh aphu ao tangngak doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimouh teh het talaivan dawk banghai sin laipalah tho awh dawkvah, banghai sin laipalah bout tâco awh han tie teh a kamceng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, canei khohna han tawn e ca dawk lungkuep awh sei .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tawnta han ka ngai e taminaw teh dumyennae dawk thoseh, karap dawk thoseh, taminaw kamkonae dawk ka bawt sak e radueknae dawk thoseh, ouk a bo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tangka lungpatawnae teh kahawihoehe hno pueng e a kung lah ao. Taminaw teh tangka thouk a hounloun awh dawkvah, yuemnae dawk hoi lam a phen awh teh, lungreithainae hoi runae a kâpoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Oe! Cathut e tami, nang teh hote yonnae hah roun loe. Lannae, Cathut lawk dawk khosaknae, yuemnae, lungpatawnae, panguepnae, lungdo lungnemnae hah pou pâlei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yuemnae hoi kâkuen e, kahawi e kâtuknae hah tuk nateh, a yungyoe hringnae hah kuen nateh tawn loe. Nang teh hote hringnae hanlah, kaw lah na o dawkvah, kapanuekkhaikungnaw e hmalah kahawicalah na pâpho toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrih Jisuh a kamnue ditouh, nang teh tounhoehe lah na o nahanlah, kaie kâpoelawk na tarawi nahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a cawngca pueng kahring sak e Cathut hmalah hai thoseh, Pontius Pailat bawi hmalah hai thoseh, kahawicalah pâphonae lahoi kampangkhai e Bawipa Jisuh Khrih hmalah hai thoseh, kai ni kâ na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tue a kuep toteh Cathut ni Khrih a kamnue sak han. Cathut teh yawhawinae ao teh, buet touh dueng e ukkung Bawi lah ao. Siangpahrang pueng e Siangpahrang, bawi pueng e Bawi lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa dueng doeh duenae dawk hoi kahlout niteh, rek hnai thai hoeh e angnae dawk kaawm. Taminaw thung dawk api buet touh nihai Cathut teh hmawt awh boihoeh, hmawt hai hmawt thai awh hoeh. Hote Cathut teh bahu hoi barinae a yungyoe awm lawiseh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atu e hringnae dawk tangka katawntanaw teh, kâoupnae lung tawn laipalah, kangning hoeh e hnopai kâuep laipalah, maimouh ni coe hane ka kuep lah na ka poe e kahring Cathut kâuep nahanlah cingthui loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ayânaw hanlah hnokahawi saknae, nuencang kahawi hoi kamsi laipalah ka poe e naw lah coungkacoe ao awh nahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hringnae katang a coe awh nahanelah due hnukkhu hringnae adu a ung thai awh nahanlah cingthui loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Oe! Timote, nang koe na poe e naw hah tarawi loe, Cathut lawk hoi kâkuen hoeh e ayawmyin lah dei e lawknaw hoi, talai thoumthainae lahoi kâtaran lah deinae hah roun loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote talai thoumnae hah, tami tangawn ni kampangkhai e lahoi, yuemnae lamthung a phen awh toe. Nang koe lungmanae awm lawiseh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
